  "bodyHash": "T/lUZN93VzA=",
  "content": "你好世界<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>工具提示全面革新 ✨</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">為 Minecraft 工具提示帶來完整的視覺翻新，以更清晰的版面完全取代原版工具提示系統。每個工具提示都<em>更現代、更銳利、更清晰</em>。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>核心功能</strong> 🔧</h1>\n<p>📜 <strong>可捲動的工具提示</strong> - 當工具提示過高超出螢幕範圍時，您可以<em>捲動</em>瀏覽其內容。<br>✂️ <strong>文字換行</strong> - 透過在需要時<em>插入換行符</em>，防止工具提示過寬。<br>🦋​ <strong>裝備比較</strong> - 內建可切換的裝備比較功能，可將護甲部件與當前裝備的護甲進行比較。您可以在遊戲中更改按鍵綁定。<br>🤝 <strong>相容性</strong> - 與 <em>JEI</em>、<em>EMI</em>、<em>ModernFix</em>、<em>Flerovium</em>、<em>FTB Quests</em>、<em>Apotheosis</em>、<em>等</em>模組相容。<br>🎨 <strong>最大程度自訂</strong> - 您可以更改、裁剪、擴展和移動<em>任何</em>您想要的內容！在眾多選項中<em>自由自訂</em>！<br>📊 <strong>評級元素</strong> - 在物品名稱下方，會顯示<em>稀有度/品質標示</em>（可配置，預設關閉）。<br>⚡ <strong>效果與框架</strong> - 可選擇動態<em>框架</em>、疊加層和自訂樣式等內容。<br>🧩 <strong>模組相容性</strong> - 任何模組都可以添加自己的自訂框架。<br>🌀 <strong>3D 物品渲染</strong> - 懸停在物品上時會顯示 3D 圖示。<br>🎲 <strong>漸暈效果</strong> - 一種新型裝飾，允許您為工具提示添加各種形狀的內部漸層。<br>❄️ <strong>遊戲內配置畫面</strong> - 此外，可以開啟完全自訂的配置畫面，從遊戲內存取設定。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">📦 <em><strong>預設情況下，部分原版物品包含框架。</strong></em><br>如果您喜歡這個想法，我們可以為最受歡迎的模組創建自訂框架並添加原生支援。🙌</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">此模組高度可配置。如有任何問題、疑難、貢獻、關於內容/模組的新想法等，您可以加入我們的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">💬 官方 Discord</a> 並在相應的頻道中留言。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a255b953-62ec-43d7-b4b3-8a1a94b36bac.png\" alt=\"Discord Banner\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">所有錯誤報告或功能請求都應直接向我提出，您可以加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>配置 ⚙️</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">有<strong>兩種</strong>方式配置工具提示：<em>全域</em>或<em>特定</em>配置。📝</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;對於<strong>全域配置</strong>，您必須修改檔案 </span></span> <code>config/tooltipoverhaul/tooltipoverhaul.toml</code><span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，該檔案包含適用於所有物品的配置選項。</span></span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;對於<strong>特定配置</strong> <em>（針對特定物品、標籤或命名空間/模組ID）</em>，您必須修改位於&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;<code>config/tooltipoverhaul/custom_frames.json</code><span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的檔案。有關如何操作此檔案的更多資訊，請參閱此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>wiki</strong></a>。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>要重新載入<strong>特定配置</strong>，您可以使用指令 <code>'/tooltipoverhaul reload'</code>，無需重新啟動遊戲，而全域設定會自動重新載入！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>資源包 🎨</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也可以創建<strong>資源包</strong>來添加自訂框架或自訂配置。更多資訊，請查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Custom-Frame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>wiki</strong></a>。<br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>查看</strong>以下<em>材質包</em>，它們添加了<em>更多</em>框架和功能！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jolly-tooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_139f83d7-2461-4ef3-a360-c3eeb241a7cb.gif\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>展示 📷</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更多資訊，請查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Content-and-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">wiki</a>。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>圖示動畫</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>縮放</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_710de09a-00ff-4dbf-a52c-e7fd191a8238.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>旋轉</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_96fcdc92-aec7-4e72-8362-0afc6bf10907.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>快速旋轉</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_f662105e-aaac-45f1-9fcd-86e07fc98f25.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>旋轉縮放</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_8e693f98-e831-4747-a49a-780caaac7e4f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>快速縮放</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0801c7e9-7401-4411-9813-55470e190b0f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>傾斜</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_daf92bbe-e6e4-4615-bd68-9c9e7445f77e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>震動</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_da3a6e73-2f1f-4351-8708-1eeac1fb7c2c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>波浪傾斜</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e9de8114-60b6-4eea-9490-165cd845469f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>翻轉</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_7ade282e-49b3-4c28-bdb2-d7a77d610bf3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>擺動</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e907728e-75aa-4f50-8115-d457a7eeeb19.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>彈跳</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_867a38c4-1f48-4396-a8bf-9504fab84ea3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>下降</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_b39aef12-e088-4801-8971-7962fbef5c99.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>脈衝</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_d41863b1-11a5-4c07-a127-ff15524f20ab.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>扇形展開</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_5c43e9d5-03fc-4497-8c1b-c2c367c32a9c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>懸停彈出</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_da470af0-1239-4df2-ad7f-64c6bd63405f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>桶滾</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e8ea3b98-47b1-42a9-bdb0-e26d2c7eb643.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>效果</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>金屬閃光</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qFedqV8.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><br>星雲<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_745e0555-e12a-43df-abfb-0f4b48e7af3a.gif\" width=\"398\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>回聲</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c9a01ea9-6960-479a-8bb2-cce21d559607.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>速度線</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_14d36d67-1da3-4bcd-a606-196a7286913a.gif\" width=\"405\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>白色塵埃</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_85b3c1da-5800-4828-a267-092facdfad7c.gif\" width=\"403\" height=\"227\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>星系</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_55e6c529-e55d-440a-a78b-9996fcc93731.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>螺旋</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0607039c-7936-4500-8753-89dde6b156df.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>光球</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_1d08b434-77a6-4808-b0c8-32f06abe3ee7.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>邊緣光</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o0gMIwU.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>漣漪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FwumAw7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>聲納</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LRU7jVR.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>星星</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wiTPtpy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>餘燼</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N1Yfe7n.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>框架疊加層</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 琥珀框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_baca4ef8-e32c-4943-9b72-585d14a90757.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 紫水晶框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_9422751d-3e2e-4924-a7b0-8b49d1eb11f2.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 天使框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_6dcb7eeb-a5dd-4ac0-9480-cb60ee7a7ad4.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 戰鬥框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_07bf3456-f9c7-4345-8faf-9889396b8228.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 災變框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ebb1c767-10e9-48e2-8567-456b1b84f968.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 惡魔框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ca5a36e8-c693-4b07-a6a6-67c2fa92c023.gif\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 鑽石框架.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ab4b1236-659a-4298-9cae-5ef103383adb",
